{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uwATqcnlVC1795776746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一艘由上環往深圳蛇口的客輪，在青衣油庫對出懷疑失控撞到船塢設施，22人受傷，5人一度情況嚴重。有業界估計客輪因機件故障導致意外。</p><p></p><p>涉事客輪「新迅隆貳號」，事發後被拖到青衣友聯船廠，船頭撞至凹陷，近看可見到油漆剝落，船頭大量物品被撞跌。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHIP-1830-1_CLEAN_20261127_183120_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RpLlmEBlOu1795776759.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方上午約9時半接報，一艘載著46人由上環往蛇口的客輪，駛至青衣油庫對出，懷疑失控撞到船塢設施。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-18h54m04s533.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u5l0CDkdj71795776924.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>大批救護人員趕到現場，消防亦出動消防船協助，用擔架將傷者從船上救出，有傷者要戴上頸箍。救援工作期間，船廠出入口全面封鎖，只容許救護車、消防車及警車駛入。傷者全部清醒，送往瑪嘉烈醫院及仁濟醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-18h54m15s849.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vtjflEH6jA1795776941.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>涉事客輪為高速雙體客輪，由深圳招商迅隆船務營運，由上環港澳碼頭駛往蛇口，航程約一小時。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHIP-1830-1_CLEAN_20261127_183120_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hRGAX1e3yx1795776792.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>由本台取得的客輪航行軌跡圖看到，涉事客輪駛原本一直向北直線行駛，到青衣油庫時，突然右轉之後撞上船塢。有業界人士就估計意外或因機件故障導致。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-18h54m42s424.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RjXkf0y0t71795776956.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>香港海員工會主席周德礎說：「因為我們是兩邊噴桶，一邊有問題，就會向有問題那邊轉，差不多1分鐘左右，船已經偏轉了90度，這個就是極度不尋常。通常要轉如此大角度，要不就去避開垃圾，要不就是主機有問題。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-18h55m01s667.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LEknYNbUKv1795776973.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他又指客輪撞上的船塢存在已久，相信一般船員都熟知地形。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.798343+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":507,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:31.711305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:18.732538+00:00","content_hash":"9b486c73218c210ae4e74eca2412828edb95611395bb38b936394d8aac073a28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.798343+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}